# Snapshot reference images (SnapshotKitTesting writes them under __Snapshots__/)
# are binary and accumulate over time, so store them in Git LFS. Scoped to the
# snapshot directory by name so existing plain-blob PNGs (app icons, preview
# assets) are untouched, and so future modules that adopt snapshot testing are
# covered automatically.
**/__Snapshots__/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
